  "notes": "ERC-1271 is a magic-value surface, never a throw surface: every row above returns 0xffffffff. The vector therefore pins the two magics plus, per kernel, the digest and the deterministic RFC 6979 signature over it. The digest binds the calling script hash, so each kernel is exercised through its own forwarder and the two signatures differ by construction."
